          Technologies GmbH." Building and testing locally requires nothing. PUBLISHING an
          ASIO-enabled installer requires that countersigned agreement FIRST — a real exchange
          with Steinberg, not a click-through. The form is in the SDK ("Steinberg ASIO Licensing
          Agreement.pdf") and at steinberg.net/en/company/developers.html.

