          rejected JUCE's AGPLv3 option in item (a) below. It also cannot combine with the JUCE
          Starter EULA, which is proprietary and non-copyleft.
          ⇒ NEW INPUT TO THE DEFERRED RELICENSING DECISION, item (h): if ArtLux ever moves to
